  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Seis de Copas fala de memória, infância e ternura.",
      "Ele representa o passado que pode nutrir ou prender.",
      "O foco dele é: voltar a ser criança sem ficar presa no ontem."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The Six of Cups speaks of memory, childhood and tenderness.",
      "It stands for a past that can nourish or hold you back.",
      "Its focus: becoming a child again without getting stuck in yesterday."
    ]
  },
